ARM: dts: qcom: apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo: make the 0x52 EEPROM read-only

Risk: LOW. Only matters once CONFIG_EEPROM_AT24 is enabled.

The 24c128 at GSBI1 0x52 does not appear anywhere in the vendor board files,
so its content and purpose are unknown. Expose it read-only so that nothing
can overwrite it by accident through the nvmem/eeprom sysfs file.
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts
index 7712851..0d86b28 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts
@@ -141,6 +141,7 @@
 		compatible = "atmel,24c128";
 		reg = <0x52>;
 		pagesize = <32>;
+		read-only;
 	};
 
 	bq27541@55 {
